I would build this as **an interactive digital encyclopedia of the Seerah of Prophet Muhammad ﷺ**, rather than just a traditional biography website.

The goal would be to allow someone to explore his entire life chronologically, from the events preceding his birth until his death, including miracles, prophecies, revelations, battles, journeys, family, companions, teachings and lesser-known incidents.

Most importantly, every historical event should be supported by Islamic sources, with clear distinctions between authentic, weak and disputed narrations.

